Rex BibTeX8 / MakeIndex WebAssembly runtime

Built from TeX Live 2026.0 using Emscripten 4.0.23, with only BibTeX8,
MakeIndex 2.18 and kpathsea. Dispatcher from TeXlyre commit
46ebb6216a5c1fe63dd1dc885831d1a8cef2dc86; its integration is AGPL-3.0.
Original BusyTeX is MIT. BibTeX8 retains GPL-2.0-or-later; MakeIndex
and kpathsea retain the terms in their corresponding TeX Live sources.
Emscripten's generated loader/runtime retains its MIT/NCSA terms.

Corresponding source:
https://github.com/TeX-Live/texlive-source/tree/tags/texlive-2026.0/texk/bibtex-x
https://github.com/TeX-Live/texlive-source/tree/tags/texlive-2026.0/texk/makeindexk
https://github.com/TeX-Live/texlive-source/tree/tags/texlive-2026.0/texk/kpathsea
https://github.com/TeXlyre/texlyre-busytex-build/tree/46ebb6216a5c1fe63dd1dc885831d1a8cef2dc86
https://github.com/emscripten-core/emsdk/tree/4.0.23

The dispatcher is included as busytex.c. Rebuild with npm run build:tools;
scripts/build-busytex.sh contains source pins and compiler/linker options.
Rex applet algorithms are unchanged. The generated module adds an ES module
export and conditional Node loader. No additional TeX engines, ICU or
font-rendering libraries are linked into this runtime.
